    "what": "Raw logs emitted by the REAL LaunchpadKitV2, LatchLPLocker and LatchBinLPLocker, captured with vm.recordLogs in a forge test that drives packages/launchpad/test/kitv2/KitV2Fixture.sol (real Vault, CL/Bin pool managers, position managers, Permit2, guards, registries, fee controller V3). address/topics/data are encoder output, copied verbatim; nothing was hand-typed.",
